  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"852\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"605\">BelleVie Cosmetic</strong> is a high-end European beauty brand based in Latvia and USA, committed to crafting clean, effective skincare using natural, vegan, and cruelty-free ingredients. Our mission is to empower people to feel confident in their skin while protecting the planet.</p><p data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"1158\">We offer premium skincare essentials that blend nature and science — including hydrating hyaluronic acid serums, anti-aging creams with advanced peptides, and gentle botanical cleansers. All BelleVie products are made without harsh chemicals, GMOs, or artificial fragrances, and are packaged sustainably.</p><p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1405\">As a brand, we stand for clean beauty, ethical skincare, and visible results. Loved by customers across the USA, UK, and Europe, BelleVie is perfect for affiliates who want to promote eco-conscious, high-performance skincare that truly delivers.</p><p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1460\"><strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1460\">Join us in redefining beauty for 2025 and beyond.</strong></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: var(--main-surface-tertiary) transparent; margin: 0.5rem 0px; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, system-ui, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, 'Apple Color Emoji', Arial, sans-serif, 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16px; text-align: left; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: var(--main-surface-tertiary) transparent; font-weight: 600; color: var(--tw-prose-bold); border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227);\">Product Description:</strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; scrollbar-color: var(--main-surface-tertiary) transparent; border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227);\